[Name] LibDrm
[Summary] Userspace interface to kernel DRM services
[Description] Library for accessing the kernel's Direct Rendering Manager interface (used by Mesa, the X server, Wayland compositors such as wlroots, and XWayland). Bumped to 2.4.121 for the Wayland/XWayland build (ISO ships 2.4.100).
[License] MIT
[Homepage] https://dri.freedesktop.org/wiki/
